>60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">kg</span></span></span></span></span>，选 <strong>C</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>&quot;一句口诀三秒完成&quot;</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;最少乘 5 最大乘 10&quot;</strong>：每跨一条箭头，&quot;最少&quot;用 5 倍（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>÷</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\div20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">÷</span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span>）、&quot;最多&quot;用 10 倍（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>÷</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\div10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">÷</span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span>）反推。\n本题两条链各两级：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4\\times10\\times10+0.6\\times10\\times10=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：传递效率 20% ⇔ 每升一级要&quot;前一营养级 5 倍&quot;；10% ⇔ 10 倍——直接用倍数乘，比连除更快、少犯错。</p>\n<p>30 秒出 C。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"某生态系统的食物网为：草→兔→鹰、草→鼠→鹰。鹰每增加 1 k g 1\\,\\mathrm{kg} 1 kg 同化量，其食物 2 5 \\dfrac25 5 2 ​ 来自兔、 3 5 \\dfrac35 5 3 ​ 来自鼠。相邻营养级间能量传递效","source":"自编（经典考法：最多/最少 取 10%/20% 的对照题）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"最多需要生产者 ⇒ 传递效率取最小 10%；食物来源比例先把最高营养级的增量按比例分配，再逐级除以 0.1；最后求和。别把 25（最少）与 100（最多）混淆——看清\"至少/最多\"两个词。","fit":["最多需要草/生产者","10% 传递效率","选填题"],"updated":"Fri Mar 07 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"ecology","title":"生物与环境"},{"slug":"ecosystem","title":"群落与生态系统"},{"slug":"energy-flow-max","title":"能量流动变式·最多需要生产者（10% 取法）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"ecosystem","title":"群落与生态系统","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"energy-flow-network","title":"能量流动多链计算·先分配再除以效率（模板）","type":"example"},{"slug":"energy-flow","title":"能量流动计算（10%/20% 传送带）","type":"example"},{"slug":"matter-energy-cycle","title":"物质循环与能量流动·特点辨析","type":"example"},{"slug":"niche-succession","title":"群落演替类型判断（弃耕农田）","type":"example"}]}